From dbec9bb1671323139af988b95d8c74855121595d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanju Abraham <s.abraham@f5.com>
Date: Wed, 27 May 2026 23:57:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] feat(governance): add UserID to VirtualKey + migrations

- Adds optional UserID FK on TableVirtualKey alongside
  TeamID / CustomerID / AccessProfileID; BeforeSave now enforces
  4-way mutual exclusion (a VK can be pinned to at most one of:
  user, team, customer, access profile).
- Adds optional UserID FK on TableBudget alongside TeamID /
  VirtualKeyID / ProviderConfigID; BeforeSave now enforces 4-way
  mutual exclusion (a budget can have at most one owner).
- Adds three idempotent migrations following the existing
  go-gormigrate pattern in migrations.go:
    * add_governance_users_table
    * add_virtual_key_user_id_column
    * add_budget_user_id_column

Rebased against current bifrost-aigw HEAD which now includes
AccessProfileID on TableVirtualKey (added by the
add_vk_access_profile_id_column migration).
---
 framework/configstore/migrations.go        | 133 +++++++++++++++++++++
 framework/configstore/tables/budget.go     |   8 +-
 framework/configstore/tables/virtualkey.go |  15 ++-
 3 files changed, 149 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

